   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "88037700-c16c-4c6a-9550-e38bce8e9026"],
 " draws this at ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " = 0.6: the rod (thick red) of rest length ",
 StyleBox["L", "TI"],
 " = 0.15 along Bob's line of simultaneity through its front event, and \
Alice's measurement of it (orange) along her own line of simultaneity through \
that event, at one radar time, with her four radar rays. The orange bar is \
the rod of length ",
 StyleBox["L", "TI"],
 "/\[Gamma] = 0.12 that she measures; its reference page reads both lengths \
off the drawing."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"25e5a63a-a4da-41fb-9679-529d493b5d97"],

